* Educational long-channel models; no PDK or silicon calibration.
* KP: A/V^2; TOX: m; CGSO/CGDO: F/m; LAMBDA: 1/V.
.model NMOS_EDU NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.45 KP=200u LAMBDA=0.03
+ GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7 TOX=20n CGSO=200p CGDO=200p)
.model PMOS_EDU PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.45 KP=80u LAMBDA=0.04
+ GAMMA=0.4 PHI=0.7 TOX=20n CGSO=200p CGDO=200p)
